{
  "name": "Laser Rifle",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "value": "<p>A firearm from a distant future, which characters might find in the wreck of a crashed spaceship.</p><p><strong>Reload.</strong> The weapon can fire 30 shots before it must be reloaded, which takes an action or a Bonus Action.</p><p><strong>Ammunition.</strong> This weapon draws its power from Energy Cells, which become depleted; they might be recharged with the proper equipment, at the GM’s discretion.</p><p><strong>Availability.</strong> If such a weapon can be bought, treat it as a Very Rare magic item.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-qsKWtDLVz1Y6YGFt\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Each attack spends one of the weapon’s shots, shown as its uses, and one piece of ammunition; <em>Reload</em> restores every shot.</p></section>"
    },
